     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">At least 2 PICs provided with policy advice and knowledge on establishment of Right to Information regimes.
At least 3 PICTs
At least 10 corruption related stories from at least 2 national media outlets
At least 1 PICTs
At least 2 PICTs
At least 1 PICTs 
