     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">2 PICs provided with policy advice and knowledge on establishment of Right to Information regimes (FSM and Samoa).
6 PICTs (Samoa, Palau, Solomon Islands, Tonga, Fiji, Vanuatu).
More than 115 corruption-related stories have been published, including coverage on Solomon Islands, Tonga, Cook, Vanuatu, Samoa, Palau, and Fiji. 
Ongoing work in 2 PICTs. (In Fiji and Solomon Islands, initial analysis and consultations with institutions have been completed by UNDP towards facilitating inter-institutional dialogue on diagnosis of regulatory and practical challenges, opportunities, and identification of ways forward for public service excellence and identification of solutions for pro-integrity and more efficient public service).
6 PICTs &#x2013; through partnership between the public finance management project and UNPRAC.
Ongoing work on finalization of a public reporting publication to be shared with at least 3 PICs.
Ongoing work in 2 PICs (Fiji and Solomon Islands)
Corruption risk assessment methodology developed and implemented in one institution in SOI
2 sectors (public sector, private sector) in Fiji through the public integrity campaign
3 PICTs with strengthened ethics in women-owned businesses (Palau, Samoa, Fiji)</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
